  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Courier is an employee of the Karlan Trade Co. LTD, and was born in Kjerag. He is part of the cooperation agreement between the Karlan Trade Co. and Rhodes Island, by which he helps carry out missions for the latter.",
        "zh": "讯使，谢拉格出身，喀兰贸易公司成员。作为喀兰贸易公司与罗德岛合作协定的一部分，以外派人员身份参与罗德岛任务。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging tests reveal clear, normal outlines of internal organs, and no abnormal shadows have been detected. Originium granules have not been detected in the circulatory system and there is no sign of infection. At this time, this Operator is believed to be non-infected.\n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 0%\nOperator shows no signs of infection at this time.\n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.12u/L\nThis Operator has rarely come into contact with Originium.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓清晰，未见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测未见异常，无矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为非矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】0%\n干员讯使没有被源石感染的迹象。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.12u/L\n干员讯使甚少接触源石。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Courier's keen sense of the terrain and environment is entirely from years of experience. In fact, when he was a child, he was not only unfamiliar with the roads, but he would even get lost. The way he tells it, he once got snowbound when he went out to play and almost didn't make it home alive. Fortunately, SilverAsh was hunting nearby and found him, thus returning him to safety. Because of this, no matter who might try to convince or threaten him to turn his back on SilverAsh, Courier will forever be the man's most faithful supporter.",
        "zh": "讯使对地形和环境的敏锐直觉完全来自于长年累月的经验积累，事实上，小时候的他不仅不怎么识路，甚至还会迷路。据他所说，在一次外出游玩时曾经被风雪困住，差点就没法活着回家了。幸好在那附近狩猎野味的银灰发现了他，才让讯使能够安然活到现在。因此，无论其他势力如何威逼利诱，讯使永远是银灰最忠实的拥护者。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "As a race living in the cold regions of the plateau, the Itra have extraordinary resilience and endurance. Courier is no exception. Still, he likes to keep a low profile. He does everything with skill and with ease, and never lets anyone sees the limits of his abilities. Even SilverAsh is unaware of just what this Itra is capable of.",
        "zh": "作为生活在高原严寒地区的种族，依特拉人有着非比寻常的韧性与耐力，讯使也是如此。不过，讯使是个韬光养晦的人，他似乎做什么都游刃有余，从不会让人察知自己的能力极限，即使是银灰，也不知道这位依特拉人到底能做到什么程度。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "People enjoy having their letters delivered by Courier. Not only thanks to his attractive face and sunny disposition, but also because the letters he delivers have a faint fragrance about them. When the topic comes up, Courier will immediately change the subject. If pressed on it, he will hem and haw and his face will blush, a side of Courier very rarely seen.",
        "zh": "人们喜欢从讯使手中接受信件。不仅仅是因为他那吸引人的面庞和阳光的性格，被他所递送的信件总有一股淡淡的香味也是原因之一。在谈及这件事时，讯使会立刻岔开话题，如果继续追问就会变得支支吾吾，脸也会变红，和平时的他完全不一样。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 4",
        "zh": "档案资料四",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Courier rarely loses his signature faint smile, though it should be noted that he has another side - a calm, tranquil, and peaceful side characteristic of one from the snowlands. Only his enemies and his most trusted friends get the chance to see that side of him. If he loses his smile while talking to you, that can only mean one thing - he regards you as a dear friend.",
        "zh": "讯使很少会去掉他那标志性的，淡淡的微笑，但值得注意的是，他也有着另外的一面，那是属于雪境的，冷静，平和的一面。只有他的敌人，和他最信赖的人有机会目睹那样的面容。如果他会撤去笑容同你交谈，那只说明一件事——你已是他无可替代的挚友。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "200"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Promotion Record",
        "zh": "晋升记录",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most of the scars on Courier's body came from the people of Kjerag rather than beasts. After all, as an important man, SilverAsh has many enemies that want him dead. Courier always confronts these people in the dark. As for the fights with these rebels, only Courier's scars tell the tale - Courier himself says nary a word.",
        "zh": "讯使身上的伤痕，大多来自于谢拉格人而非野兽，毕竟银灰位高权重，有数不清的人意图刺杀他，而讯使，则永远在暗处与这些人对抗着。与叛乱者争斗的故事，他从不会说半个字，只有讯使身上的伤痕，记录着它们的存在。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "AWAKE",
      "unlockParam": "2;1"
    }
  ]
}
